  reel_script says 'நாளை சாலைப்புதூர் பகுதியில் மின்தடை' and later Sāalaipudur details; the article's Saalaipudur list is correct but the reel omits the important fact that the Ayyarpadi and Komangalampudur areas (Valparai/Pollachi) are also affected at the same time, and the Palappampatti outage is described in the reel as 'நவம்பர் 17ஆம் தேதி' with a month not in the article.
  reel_script says 'நவம்பர் 17ஆம் தேதி' for Palappampatti — the article only says 17ம் தேதி; the month is invented.
