  reel_script says the power cut covers 'மூன்று துணை மின் நிலையங்கள்' in Pollachi and Negamam, but the article gives the regions only as the three substations; attributing the locations as 'பொள்ளாச்சி, நெகமம் பகுதிகள்' is acceptable only because the information sources are those two engineers, so this is borderline but the headline and slides present Pollachi/Negamam as the area covered, which the article does not state.
